OL,3,GNEWSALeeds to pay tribute to fan who
OL,4,Adied before match
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds United have said they will pay
OL,7,Ftribute to a fan who died after
OL,8,Fsuffering a medical emergency in the
OL,9,Fstands before the team's game against
OL,10,FManchester United.
OL,12,FColin Westby was watching the match at
OL,13,FElland Road on Sunday 18 October when
OL,14,Fhe fell ill and was taken to hospital,
OL,15,Fthe club said.
OL,17,FPosting on social media, the club said
OL,18,Fthe 68-year-old was placed in a
OL,19,Fmedically induced coma but, after a
OL,20,F"period of unresponsiveness", the
OL,21,Fdecision was made to withdraw life
OL,22,Fsupport.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
