OL,3,GNEWSALeeds to pay tribute to fan who
OL,4,Adied before match
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club said a tribute would be held
OL,7,Fto Colin in the 68th minute of their
OL,8,Fnext Premier League fixture against
OL,9,FTottenham Hotspur on Saturday.
